s Summary","block":213,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001213900-26-048051","form":"20-F","filedAt":"2026-04-27","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0002034723","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/2034723/000121390026048051/ea0286902-20f_oneandone.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/283f1c8af153089a7cc114c9da648b8f3802631dcea7016a8ce6a4632b009791.bin","sha256":"283f1c8af153089a7cc114c9da648b8f3802631dcea7016a8ce6a4632b009791"}},{"id":"3aa323f2bbb43d332e42e55e13dda17b3cd2abc8287d21fc7371b9bd01783979","quote":"●We may not be able to pay dividends in the future.","context":"●Our Class A Ordinary Shares may trade under $5.00 per share and thus would be known as “penny stock”. Trading in penny stocks has certain restrictions and these restrictions could negatively affect the price and liquidity of our Class A Ordinary Shares.","section":"Risk Factors Summary","block":214,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001213900-26-048051","form":"20-F","filedAt":"2026-04-27","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0002034723","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/2034723/000121390026048051/ea0286902-20f_oneandone.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/283f1c8af153089a7cc114c9da648b8f3802631dcea7016a8ce6a4632b009791.bin","sha256":"283f1c8af153089a7cc114c9da648b8f3802631dcea7016a8ce6a4632b009791"}},{"id":"281127b0b81a5a9c4eb609ec13054ce49703ebd589f8d3357b802712f45a5eed","quote":"●If we fail to meet applicable listing requirements, Nasdaq may delist our Class A Ordinary Shares from trading, in which case the liquidity and market price of our Class A Ordinary Shares could decline.","context":"●We may not be able to pay dividends in the future.","section":"Risk Factors Summary","block":215,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"acces